title: "Reduced analysis dataset and R code: Engaging Undergraduates with Urban Planning and Sustainable Mobility"
abstract: >-
  Reduced, de-identified analysis dataset and R code for a within-subjects
  experiment with 55 undergraduates at the University of Texas at Austin,
  comparing a generative AI agent with a human facilitator as ways of
  introducing students to urban planning and sustainable mobility.
